> >>>Ok, good ideas. I would propose this final API:
> >>>
> >>>1) one key with specific delimiters like:
> >>>
> >>>list		# list everything (all keys)
> >>>list/master	# list only master keys (mixer, pcm etc.)
> >>>list/mixer	# list only mixer keys
> >>>list/pcm
